The linking process follows the ELF specification.
See
.Xr elfobj 3
for references.
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn elf_link
function was added to
.Nm libelfobj
to support simple object merging for toolchain utilities.
.Sh BUGS
.Bl -bullet
.It
Only relocatable objects
.Pq Dv ET_REL
can be linked.
.It
Archive file handling is not supported.
.It
Dead code elimination is not implemented.
.It
GOT/PLT generation is not implemented.
.It
Dynamic linking structures are not generated.
.It
Section addresses are not assigned (requires full linker layout).
.El
